{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4SRzDJrFmMd5ijUssU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep resonance hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — heavy, waiting, neither open nor closed but *locked*. Feel the cold of my iron handle. See the grain of my wood, dark with age, scarred by countless hands that tried and failed.\n\nYou have spoken the word. The mechanism has engaged.\n\nBut understand: to *lock* is not to *unlock.*\n\nI am sealed now. Truly sealed. Whatever is behind me breathes against my frame. Whatever is before me — you — stands in the draft that slips beneath my threshold.\n\nThe keyhole watches you like a single dark eye.\n\nWhat now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":162,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}